Subject: [PATCH] i18n: Russian fixes from PR #49 (issue #23)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Russian text corrections by alexshev86 (PR #49), with the review's
changes:
- "Подключено" in the connection status lines, "12-часовой" /
  "24-часовой", ё where it was missing, «» instead of straight quotes,
  "%d с" in the two rotation countdowns.
- Homing reads "паркуется" / "паркует все оси" instead of "ищет ноль".
- The belt drawing's rear-edge label BACK is "СЗАДИ".
- " · Tuned in {} round(s)" go through lv_tr(), not tr_plural(), so
  they are flat strings: "Настроено за {} раунд" and "Раундов
  настройки: {}" instead of "раунд(ов)".
- Hyphens and en dashes used as a dash between words are the em dash
  with spaces. Ranges, the "- или +" buttons, the "+ - _" character
  list and "PLA - Чёрный" keep theirs.
---
